{"id":"ni","lemma":"ни","pos":"other","rank":85,"glosses":["not a","whatever, however","any, no"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/10/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B8.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он не сказал нам ни слова.","en":"He did not say a word to us.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) us","l":"мы"},null,{"g":"word, term","l":"слово"}]},{"text":"Я ни во что не верю.","en":"I don't believe in anything.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283425","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to believe, to trust","l":"верить"}]},{"text":"Я ни одного человека не видел.","en":"I didn't see a single person.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,{"g":"person","l":"человек"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"}]},{"text":"Ни у кого нет вопросов?","en":"Doesn't anyone have a question?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1275126","words":[null,{"g":"at / by"},{"g":"who","l":"кто"},{"g":"no / there isn't"},null]},{"text":"\"О чём вы говорили?\" - \"Ни о чём\".","en":"\"What did you talk about?\" \"Nothing.\"","words":[{"g":"about"},{"g":"what","l":"что"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},null,{"g":"about"},{"g":"what","l":"что"}]}]}